<title>USA: Thermo Voltek to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Thermo Voltek to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Voltek Corp said its board of directors has authorized the repurchase, through April 17, 1998, of up to $5 million of its own securities in the open market, or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Thermo Voltek will repurchase shares when they are available at prices the company considers attractive, it said.</p>
<p>No balance currently remains under the company's previous share repurchase authorization, the company added.</p>
